  [ 52] getprop 114 ............................. <sg>
  [ 54] getchainedprop 130 ...................... <sg.table>
  [ 56] pusharglistnoret 1 ...................... <sg.table>
  [ 58] objcall 471 ............................. sg.table.showNumber()
